WEBVTT

00:00:00.641 --> 00:00:03.040
A machine sale starts a long relationship.

00:00:03.349 --> 00:00:06.894
Aftersales keeps that machine working through parts availability,

00:00:07.086 --> 00:00:10.631
maintenance, repair and support across its working life.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:16.072
The manufacturer supplies product knowledge, parts and warranty

00:00:16.092 --> 00:00:16.759
support.

00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:20.798
Independent dealers bring local stock, technicians and customer

00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:21.824
relationships.

00:00:22.146 --> 00:00:24.532
The customer depends on both to keep working.

00:00:26.571 --> 00:00:29.516
Onboarding starts with business checks and agreements.

00:00:29.826 --> 00:00:33.514
Set up authorised users, product access and training.

00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:35.874
Then map the dealer data and test the

00:00:35.894 --> 00:00:38.735
connection before exchanging operational records.

00:00:40.792 --> 00:00:43.621
Dealers often run their own systems for sales,

00:00:43.722 --> 00:00:46.615
inventory, workshop jobs and finance.

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:49.783
The manufacturer portal provides a shared entry point

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:52.644
for parts, claims and technical information.

00:00:52.954 --> 00:00:54.558
Interfaces connect the two.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.806
The parts journey starts with the machine and

00:00:58.826 --> 00:00:59.975
the correct component.

00:01:00.284 --> 00:01:03.699
Check stock, place the order, manage back orders,

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.847
and deliver to the dealer or customer.

00:01:06.157 --> 00:01:07.774
Returns need a clear path too.

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:12.897
The dealer records the issue, diagnoses the fault

00:01:12.998 --> 00:01:14.212
and plans the repair.

00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:17.089
Parts and technician availability come together.

00:01:17.399 --> 00:01:20.296
After the work, record labour, replaced parts and

00:01:20.316 --> 00:01:22.298
service history against the machine.

00:01:24.321 --> 00:01:26.381
Warranty is a controlled process.

00:01:26.691 --> 00:01:30.001
The dealer submits the machine details, repair evidence,

00:01:30.115 --> 00:01:31.251
parts and labour.

00:01:31.573 --> 00:01:34.740
The manufacturer checks the claim against warranty terms,

00:01:34.907 --> 00:01:38.451
then reimburses approved claims and records the outcome.

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:43.592
The shared foundation is knowing which customer owns

00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:45.975
each machine and which dealer supports it.

00:01:46.284 --> 00:01:50.089
Connect parts orders, stock, repair history and claims.

00:01:50.412 --> 00:01:54.038
Data checks and interfaces reduce repeated entry and

00:01:54.058 --> 00:01:55.350
incomplete records.

00:01:57.404 --> 00:02:01.795
Effective aftersales connects people, processes and information.

00:02:02.118 --> 00:02:04.910
The result is a clearer service journey, better

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:08.009
parts planning, and a stronger relationship throughout the

00:02:08.029 --> 00:02:09.139
life of the machine.
